          "info": "Approximate Running Times: Foyer Doors - 7:00pm Auditorium Doors - 7:30pm Start - 8:00pm Finish - 9:20pm Moonman's new show is a carnival of his beloved characters from The Front Bar and Malcolm Turnbull. The price of each ticket includes a $1 Restoration Levy.",
